      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767002073893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. A web app which stores your imp links (url) and you can access them \n    anytime you wan \n2. This comes from me having to store links here and there and eventually \n    not finding them when I need it the most \n3. So firstly before making this for anyone,I have to create it for myself, \n    so I like the product and hence other people can also use it \n4. I haven't thought about the UI, DB or what components I'll be using, \n    however just wanna add a key feature, like when we share some links \n    a preview appears, like an X profile, a GitHub repo link, a Spotify song\n    first of all what's that called and then how to implement that ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. A web app which stores your imp links (url) and you can access them \n    anytime you wan \n2. This comes from me having to store links here and there and eventually \n    not finding them when I need it the most \n3. So firstly before making this for anyone,I have to create it for myself, \n    so I like the product and hence other people can also use it \n4. I haven't thought about the UI, DB or what components I'll be using, \n    however just wanna add a key feature, like when we share some links \n    a preview appears, like an X profile, a GitHub repo link, a Spotify song\n    first of all what's that called and then how to implement that ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
