      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1767002073893,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "` UX features\n \n1. Adding a filter to filter-out links : \n    a. added first \n    b. added last\n    c. by name\n    etc etc \n\n2. Adding a categories field which has links,  \nexample categories can be tech, youtube, insta\ncomedy, watch-later, movies, personal, or also \nfuture changes would be like users can add their \nown category and insert links inside ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "` UX features\n \n1. Adding a filter to filter-out links : \n    a. added first \n    b. added last\n    c. by name\n    etc etc \n\n2. Adding a categories field which has links,  \nexample categories can be tech, youtube, insta\ncomedy, watch-later, movies, personal, or also \nfuture changes would be like users can add their \nown category and insert links inside ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
